{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1702","id":4126573136,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p8719oJQ","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1702","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1702.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1702.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1702","number":1702,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] freeze 9709 semantic Stage 1 contracts","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1701\n\nParent program: #1700\n\n## Why\n\nStage 1 freezes independently governed semantic contracts over the 3,497 read-only structurally verified rows. Stage 2 remains denied until exact-head review passes, this PR merges, and exact-main readback completes.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added independent Layer A, B, and C schemas and disjoint state machines with rooted conservation rules.\n- Added the shared core contract, Math 9709 adapter, typed provenance, immutable additive supersession, and isolated Method Map/Copilot preview-readback contracts.\n- Froze taxonomy `9709-semantic-taxonomy-v0.1` for exactly Integration Techniques, Differential Equations, and Trigonometric Manipulation / Equations, including complete Family/Type boundaries, primary and multi-label rules, versioning, and additive supersession.\n- Froze walking (48, exactly 16 per Family), calibration (120, execution-gated), and sealed holdout (48, commitment-only) partitions. No selected row was semantically processed.\n- Preserved failed v1-v10 bundles as immutable superseded evidence. Additive v11 is authoritative for this head.\n\n## Additive v11 review remediation\n\n- Added a digest-pinned Layer A transition root and immutable source-checker ledger.\n- `source_checked -> source_verified` now requires the exact authoritative Layer A record plus the pinned transition authority ID.\n- The transition independently validates the exact Layer A record against structural/state and source-region authorities, authenticates the rooted source-check receipt, binds the nonempty checker identity, exact state edge, record/question hashes, source bindings, and all upstream authority root/ledger hashes.\n- The expected evidence bundle is reconstructed from rooted bytes. Caller-supplied dictionaries containing `status: pass` and arbitrary 64-hex hashes fail closed with `layer_a_transition_evidence_not_rooted`.\n- The exact negative `layer_a_source_verified_transition_caller_receipt_forgery` is bound into the negative receipt, composite validator, Contract Gate, deterministic replay, manifest, and zero-write proof.\n\nEarlier v9-v10 hardening remains in force: rooted B/C approval transitions; authority-rooted upstream terminal membership; single-read hash/parse and re-authenticated authority export; complete-tree manifest and zero-write path binding; exact Stage 2 denial; independently rooted sealed creation aggregates; opaque sealed custody; shared ProcedureModel semantics; evidence-backed MarkPoint to ProcedureStep bindings; alternative paths; mutation rejection; and zero prohibited/provider writes.\n\n## Gate and custody result\n\n- Contract Gate: `pass` (19/19)\n- Exact structural authority: 3,497 eligible rows; 36 safe rejections excluded\n- Negative/mutation rejections: 47; false accepts: 0\n- Walking/calibration/sealed processed: 0 / 0 / 0\n- Sealed membership JSON parsed / identifiers enumerated / disclosed: false / false / false\n- Cross-partition question and paper overlap: 0\n- Public regular files / manifested entries: 39 / 38\n- Structural/canonical/production/public/mastery/formal-KG/remote/downstream writes: 0\n- External provider calls and cost: 0 / CNY 0\n- Stage 2: denied pending exact-head PASS, merge, and exact-main readback\n\nAuthoritative v11 hashes:\n\n- exact head: `1e82c0fc48eec02a9794bdf7fa8199e4f00785d7`\n- exact tree: `b9c18e09e1efa6f59af450dbc101e473f0d17ee9`\n- artifact manifest: `2a48cc4f1a63851c1ceaa256c23f663654065b3ff1c4d1d77717cb384e09a08a`\n- Contract Gate: `12adfcb835ba53efacb993639c3a261d578ff8443ba5217eb0be084eca6f6ac8`\n- deterministic replay receipt: `09c308cc4a450bcb80823e6ffd375522f404e33ed915ee264b9ea54ea81e5a45`\n- independently reconstructed bundle: `45fe8aae5a574d4bc59463ca70b4396639fe5130e63fe8fca9a8fdc224e71faa`\n- zero-write/provider receipt: `1df09c9a58fde85e73e417c43498575cc4ba6954bbb0baa6186f60cd218dc9e8`\n- sealed commitment: `013ba2bac89595b502e50aa7b7b093d40b064ab188f2aad0c1d5c4daebed5d76`\n- Layer A transition root / ledger: `3e1252d967e38a4bf96bc7e4210d9a9ff416976e5826dd8c868784160d129e8a` / `d0057cbc441f245330f6ccd7564427e8b48b4e4852ccc652d5bc2a26b7873e35`\n- Layer A structural/state root / ledger: `d29ef645a795bb67c0877824ef60e25ba825fce63e431450e5bb2fa56d15dc46` / `cabf0cb2439355d6d8d2a74775e3d72dfa54cc4c2d07055d96f51968fb5f0057`\n- taxonomy root / bytes: `bcdbc8ec3f039798bdfe0772a2204499b22cd7b55a9d0bf4fea521936606a78c` / `67845959881b76cdd8f7f47f84e4130cc5b125a1ab9cbc395252fc2e032f2352`\n- Layer B root / ledger: `9f1cc21b00e80b11e24b27189198f23666d7e3ddebf2ec356aeec9544d033aa0` / `f408943cc3637d2def5c1f55bd7b04e4de4ded0ea675903a75d03f7dbdfc98c3`\n- Layer C root / ledger: `bf34c6742e2907675c522eee7a9708c052db062acb79d0c2b51bac6ce4ebdf73` / `fc67902e37023b156ac276c9568c539fb6bf481a6df41118c2f411b805d8490d`\n- runner: `9ac1cb3d6afbb39d841c1e2cff9e9d4b6f7298db776521cf5fbb08c822887fe1`\n\n## Verification\n\n```text\npython3 scripts/vlm/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.py\n  PASS; atomic v11 publication; 39 public files; sealed count 48; disclosed=false\n\npython3 scripts/vlm/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.py --validate-only\n  PASS; eligible=3497; safe_rejection=36; private JSON unparsed; identifiers unenumerated\n\npython3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.test.py\n  Ran 60 tests in 45.802s — OK\n\npython3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1694_final_consolidation.test.py\n  Ran 32 tests in 34.942s — OK\n\npython3 -m py_compile scripts/vlm/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.py scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1701_semantic_stage1.test.py\n  exit 0\n\ngit diff --check\n  exit 0\n```\n\n## Review boundary\n\nBind independent review to exact head `1e82c0fc48eec02a9794bdf7fa8199e4f00785d7` and tree `b9c18e09e1efa6f59af450dbc101e473f0d17ee9`. Re-run the exact Layer A dictionary-forgery probe plus all prior authority, manifest/replay/gate, opaque sealed custody, and zero-write/provider checks. Do not merge or admit Stage 2 until a fresh independent exact-head review passes.","created_at":"2026-07-24T17:21:56Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T20:54:26Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T20:32:32Z","merged_at":"2026-07-24T20:32:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"aca6973739b313ef2723c12dc31fb2d7e4cab1af","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1702/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1702/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.c